  "mensaje_para_el_cliente": "Hi Marta, this is your diet draft. Think amounts and context, not forbidden foods — nothing here is off the table. What matters is whether it holds up three months from now, not just this week. If something doesn't fit your life, say so and we'll swap it for an equivalent. We're starting with a slight calorie surplus — just enough to grow without piling on extra fat — and a bit more protein than usual to actually make use of it."
